    <title>26-《世界的主人》叫谁宝宝呢，叫主人！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe34f601567203211f578f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fe34f601567203211f578f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 15:01:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听忠武路特派！</span><br><span>本期节目我们来聊我心目中的2025年度最佳韩影：</span><strong><span>《世界的主人》</span></strong><br><span>欢迎添加主播微信</span><em><strong><span>paterson314</span></strong></em><span>加入听友群</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong><span>JC，钟秀</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾曲：</span></strong><span>칵테일 사랑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场，基本信息介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 打分推荐，钟秀-8.5分，JC-8分</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 剧本极其工整精巧</span><br><span>自我表达和大众性之间达成绝妙平衡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a>人物塑造全都在为主题服务</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a>视听调度的优秀</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a>在电影里谈论性的时候，是否能在避免对女演员剥削的情况下完成表达？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a>“苹果”代表着什么？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a>用一个玄关呈现了母亲的艰难和父亲的缺席</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">41:04</a>“洗车”名场面</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2567">42:47</a>和《蜂鸟》的对比</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a>电影里对女性议题的呈现具备先进性吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3222">53:42</a>整个故事，其实都因女主角自己的主观能动性而起？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3487">58:07</a>缺点-结尾是否有点想要的太多？</span></p>]]></description>
